好擲，政極此耳。」永元中，爲平越長史、綏建太守，卒官。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete:p014:m0026","object_person_mention_id":"c-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete:p014:m0077"}],"status":"source_attested","interpretation_note":"婦稱依原語，未見本名。","reviewer":"Codex（AI代理）","model":null,"human_reviewed":false}],"family_tree_policy":{"default":"editorial_preferred","original_assertions_preserved":true,"unreviewed_conflicts_may_remain":true,"runtime_ai_required":false},"family_paths":[],"mentions":[{"id":"c-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete:p014:m0077","start":77,"end":80,"surface":"傅蠶室","kind":"person","person_id":"oyc_1n0_hej","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete:p014","chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete"}],"relations":[{"id":"a-qi052-bianbin-wife","subject_person_id":"fha_6ju_xi9","object_person_id":"oyc_1n0_hej","predicate":"spouse","qualifiers":{"source_term":"自稱「卞田居」，婦爲「傅蠶室」"},"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-nanqishu","book_id":"b-nanqishu-052","chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete","source_id":"s-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete-ws2371079","paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete:p014","quote":"　　除南海王國郎中令，尚書比部郎，安吉令，車騎記室。彬性好飲酒，以瓠壺瓢勺杬皮爲肴，著帛冠十二年不改易，以大瓠爲火籠，什物多諸詭異。自稱「卞田居」，婦爲「傅蠶室」。或諫曰：「卿都不持操，名器何由得升？」彬曰：「擲五木子，十擲輙鞬，豈復是擲子之拙。吾好擲，政極此耳。」永元中，爲平越長史、綏建太守，卒官。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete:p014:m0026","object_person_mention_id":"c-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete:p014:m0077"}],"status":"source_attested","interpretation_note":"婦稱依原語，未見本名。","reviewer":"Codex（AI代理）","model":null,"human_reviewed":false}],"title_holdings":[],"address_assertions":[],"table_occurrences":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete:p014","text":"　　除南海王國郎中令，尚書比部郎，安吉令，車騎記室。彬性好飲酒，以瓠壺瓢